# Files and directories EXCLUDED from the WP.org distribution ZIP.
# Any pattern here is interpreted as an rsync --exclude rule (also
# compatible with `wp dist-archive` from wp-cli/dist-archive-command).
#
# Anything NOT matched here is included in the ZIP. Adding a new dev-only
# directory means adding it here in the same commit — the plugin-check CI
# job scans the filtered build, so anything missed here is scanned as if a
# wordpress.org reviewer were reading it.

# --- Version control ---
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.svn/

# --- Editor / IDE / OS ---
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db

# --- Dependencies and build output ---
node_modules/
vendor/
composer.json
composer.lock
package.json
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
Makefile
dist/
build/

# --- Development tooling ---
bin/
tools/
.github/
.coderabbit.yaml
phpcs.xml
phpcs.xml.dist
.phpcs.xml.dist

# --- Test suites and their configuration ---
# Three suites, three configs. tests-integration/ boots real WordPress and
# is the largest of them; it has no business in a merchant's plugin folder.
tests/
tests-contracts/
tests-integration/
phpunit.xml
phpunit.xml.dist
phpunit-contracts.xml
phpunit-integration.xml
.phpunit.result.cache

# --- Contributor documentation ---
README.md
CHANGELOG.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
SECURITY.md
AGENTS.md
internal-docs/

# --- Transient ---
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak

# This file itself: it describes the build, and the build is over by the
# time anyone unzips the result.
.distignore
